    {
      "id": "3d07fdde74d927e11d6ad3e7311ba4f83f38bf4a",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2139175438,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> If every EPB has a VLAN layer, don't issue warning about seeing too many VLAN layers in a single frame\n\nThis is a problem with the current state of \"Fileshark\" - it doesn't have a way to dissect each record of a file separately, with a summary pane showing a list of records; instead, it displays the entire file as a single records.  This can cause various limits to be exceeded, as well as slowing down the process of constructing the display.\n\nI'm not sure there's an easy way to do that, though.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-02T08:08:51.695Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-02T12:41:20.314Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 331221395,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 17493,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2139670506,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I will close this, and keep it in the local branch where I felt the need to write it.\nThe other thing I've done in the profile where I open these files is to make some of the 'max_tree' preferences really big (which I guess is the fuzz-testing version of 'probably infinite')..",
          "author": {
            "id": 6810036,
            "username": "martin.r.mathieson",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Martin Mathieson",
            "state": "active",
